style=\"font-weight: 400;\">While couples across the UK were lethargic about planning and thinking of their wedding, Meg and Jake took it in their stride, their mantra was very much \u2018it\u2019ll happen one day\u2019. You see, Meg and Jake are childhood sweethearts, they met through a mutual friend and are so relaxed in each other\u2019s company they wanted to marry when they could have the celebration they believed their family and friends would enjoy.<\/p>\n<p>Dear Reader,<\/p>\n<p style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Marry the person who looks at you like you\u2019re made of magic. Marry the person that looks at you the way these two look at each other. I\u2019m delighted to introduce you to Meg &amp; Jake.<\/p>\n<p>Gail.x.<\/p>\n<p style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><em>What can I say, Gail is the best wedding planner ever!! She made the experience of planning our wedding with a newborn so much easier, she is professional, attentive and most of all a lovely person who I will forever remain in contact with. Gail made our day so special and we didn\u2019t have to worry about a thing, she makes sure everything runs so smoothly and you can just relax and enjoy. Thank you so much Gail for being so brilliant we couldn\u2019t of done it without you xx<\/em><\/p>\n<p>Photographs by kind permission of Meg &amp; Jake and https:\/\/www.lloydwilliamsphotography.com\/<\/p>\n<p>Full Wedding Planning, Styling and Decor by Eleanor Gail.<\/p>\n<p><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-10490\" src=\"https:\/\/eleanorgail.co.uk\/wp-content\/uploads\/SO107296-scaled.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1707\" srcset=\"https:\/\/eleanorgail.co.uk\/wp-content\/uploads\/SO107296-200x133.jpg 200w, https:\/\/eleanorgail.co.uk\/wp-content\/uploads\/SO107296-300x200.jpg 300w, https:\/\/eleanorgail.co.uk\/wp-content\/uploads\/SO107296-400x267.jpg 400w, https:\/\/eleanorgail.co.uk\/wp-content\/uploads\/SO107296-600x400.jpg 600w, https:\/\/eleanorgail.co.uk\/wp-content\/uploads\/S